  unitName: Djin
  unitId: 40082
  unitNumber: 106
  description: A powerful spirit said to freely control the wind. Magically stronger
    than sylphs, they are positive and friendly, albeit very fickle. Since they are
    so fickle, they are said to be lucky in a way. Rumor is that befriending a Djin
    is extremely lucky, though this is only a rumor. Recently it seems they enjoy
    hiding and blowing wind up travelers' backsides.
  summonDesc: Thank you for summoning me!<br>I was getting so bored.<br>Let me show
    you my wind!
  fusionDesc: Here, here. Come closer.<br>You are too easy!
  evoDesc: "Huh!\u3000Evolution?!<br>Just look at me now!"
